# Everything the engagement produces about a real organisation. The answer
# store names roles and carries MTD figures and OCIDs; the session transcripts
# name people and quote them; the realisation ledger records which parts of the
# estate do not exist. The transcripts are the most sensitive artefact here.
# Ignore the directory wholesale rather than naming files, so a new artefact
# is private by default instead of private only if somebody remembers.
.itscm/

# Discovery output: a complete inventory of a live tenancy.
discovery-output/
dr-resources.env
*.dr-resources.env

# Python bytecode. The plugin trust fingerprint hashes every file in the
# plugin directory, so a stray __pycache__ makes picoagent treat the plugin
# as changed and skip loading it until it is trusted again.
__pycache__/

# Working files
*.tmp
.DS_Store
